abstract: >-
  Deterministic reference for the maximum absolute component residual between
  two 32-component real vectors, with a strict-inequality failure criterion
  (ADR-001 normative definition). Research software; SYNTHETIC test vectors
  only; no empirical, hardware, or medical claims.
